{
  "slug": "letter-for-myself",
  "name": "Letter For Myself",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Writes a letter after each /save-checkpoint. Letters are versioned in git. Creates Blog Posts out of Letters. Connect to nyxCore for implementing Project Wisdom and use it in your CLI.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **1 agent** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `letter-checkpoint` (Writes a structured markdown summary (The Letter) to the .memory/ folder), `letter-init` (Initialize the Letter to Blog pipeline to transform memory files into public-ready blog posts via CI/CD)\n- **Agents** (1): `letter-for-myself` (An agent designed to summarize work and persist context between sessions)\n- **Hooks** (2): `Setup`, `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install letter-for-myself@claude-community` from `mrwind-up-bird/letter-for-my-future-self`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 2
  },
